{
  "_comment": [
    "Template for .mcp.json (gitignored, because the real file holds a credential).",
    "Copy to .mcp.json and fill in the token.",
    "",
    "Only Supabase is configured. The filesystem server duplicated Claude Code's",
    "built-in file tools; the reference puppeteer and github servers were",
    "archived upstream \u2014 use the built-in browser pane (or Playwright via",
    "`just e2e-login`) and the `gh` CLI instead.",
    "",
    "--project-ref pins the server to this project's database so it cannot list",
    "or touch other projects on the account. The database is still shared with",
    "fantasy-pulse (fp_* tables are off-limits \u2014 see AGENTS.md); the PreToolUse",
    "guard in .claude/hooks enforces that.",
    "",
    "`--prefer-offline` is load-bearing in the devcontainer: plain `npx -y`",
    "re-fetches the packument from registry.npmjs.org (Cloudflare anycast the",
    "egress firewall can only partially pin) on every server start, which can hang",
    "until the MCP startup timeout. post-create.sh warms the cache with",
    "`npm install -g` before the firewall comes up."
  ],
  "mcpServers": {
    "supabase": {
      "command": "npx",
      "args": [
        "--prefer-offline",
        "-y",
        "@supabase/mcp-server-supabase",
        "--project-ref=rbinbcwinchphipvcfqk"
      ],
      "env": {
        "SUPABASE_ACCESS_TOKEN": "<your Supabase personal access token, sbp_...>"
      }
    }
  }
}
